{
  "slug": "gorealo-preapproval-next-step",
  "name": "GoRealo — Application follow-up",
  "description": "Subject: Ready to turn your home search into a plan? | Preheader: A preapproval can help clarify a realistic shopping range.",
  "type": "email",
  "builder": "mailpurse",
  "html_content": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Ready to turn your home search into a plan?</title></head><body style=\"margin:0;background:#f1f4f8;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all\">A preapproval can help clarify a realistic shopping range.</div><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background:#f1f4f8\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:24px 12px\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:600px;background:#fff\"><tr><td style=\"padding:24px 30px;border-top:5px solid #1459d9\"><a href=\"https://www.gorealo.com/\"><img src=\"https://www.gorealo.com/media/site-assets/gorealo-logo.svg\" width=\"154\" alt=\"GoRealo\" style=\"display:block;width:154px;max-width:100%;height:auto;border:0\"></a><p style=\"margin:9px 0 0;color:#667085;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1.5px\">MORTGAGE OPTIONS, MADE CLEAR</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:30px;background:#f0f5ff\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#1459d9;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px\">WHEN YOU’RE READY</p><h1 style=\"font-size:30px;line-height:1.2;margin:0 0 16px;color:#162849\">A clear next step can make the search easier.</h1><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#374151;margin:0 0 14px\">Hi {{first_name}}, if you’re preparing to shop for a home, a mortgage preapproval can help you understand your options and what information a lender needs.</p><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#162849;font-weight:bold;margin:0\">Do you have a target month for your move?</p><p style=\"margin:20px 0 0\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sirushtide/mailerfox/main/resources/email-templates/gorealo/assets/GiveBuyersReasonToSayYes.png\" alt=\"GoRealo: Application follow-up\" width=\"540\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:540px;height:auto;border:0;border-radius:8px\"></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:22px 30px\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tr><td style=\"padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e5eaf1\"><h2 style=\"font-size:17px;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 7px;color:#162849\">Know what to gather</h2><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#4b5563;margin:0\">Income, assets, debts, and property details may be part of the review. Requirements depend on your situation.</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e5eaf1\"><h2 style=\"font-size:17px;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 7px;color:#162849\">Keep your plans flexible</h2><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#4b5563;margin:0\">A preapproval is not a final loan approval. Your eligibility and terms depend on underwriting and the property.</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e5eaf1\"><h2 style=\"font-size:17px;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 7px;color:#162849\">Ask before you apply</h2><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#4b5563;margin:0\">If you want to talk through the process first, reply to this email and tell us what is unclear.</p></td></tr></table><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#374151;margin:22px 0\">Reply with your timing and we can help you understand the next step. No pressure if you’re still planning.</p><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#374151\">Warmly,<br><strong>The GoRealo Team</strong></p><table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"margin:22px 0\"><tr><td bgcolor=\"#1459d9\" style=\"border-radius:4px\"><a href=\"https://www.gorealo.com/apply-now\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 24px;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold\">Start a preapproval</a></td></tr></table><p style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#667085\">Prefer to talk? Call <a href=\"tel:+18667139292\" style=\"color:#1459d9\">1-866-713-9292</a> or reply to this email.</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:20px 30px;background:#f4f6f9\"><p style=\"font-size:11px;line-height:1.7;color:#667085;margin:0\">GoRealo® is a DBA of Consumer Credit Services, LLC. NMLS #1070755 · Florida Mortgage Broker License #MBR1434.<br>5011 Gate Parkway Bldg 100, Suite 100, Jacksonville, FL 32256.<br>Equal Housing Opportunity. Credit, collateral, eligibility, and program terms apply.</p><p style=\"font-size:11px;line-height:1.7;color:#667085\"><a href=\"https://www.gorealo.com/privacy-policy/\" style=\"color:#1459d9\">Privacy</a> · <a href=\"{{unsubscribe_url}}\" style=\"color:#1459d9\">Unsubscribe</a></p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
  "plain_text_content": "Ready to turn your home search into a plan? A preapproval can help clarify a realistic shopping range. MORTGAGE OPTIONS, MADE CLEAR WHEN YOU’RE READY A clear next step can make the search easier. Hi {{first_name}}, if you’re preparing to shop for a home, a mortgage preapproval can help you understand your options and what information a lender needs. Do you have a target month for your move? Know what to gather Income, assets, debts, and property details may be part of the review. Requirements depend on your situation. Keep your plans flexible A preapproval is not a final loan approval. Your eligibility and terms depend on underwriting and the property. Ask before you apply If you want to talk through the process first, reply to this email and tell us what is unclear. Reply with your timing and we can help you understand the next step. No pressure if you’re still planning. Warmly, The GoRealo Team Start a preapproval Prefer to talk? Call 1-866-713-9292 or reply to this email. GoRealo® is a DBA of Consumer Credit Services, LLC. NMLS #1070755 · Florida Mortgage Broker License #MBR1434. 5011 Gate Parkway Bldg 100, Suite 100, Jacksonville, FL 32256. Equal Housing Opportunity. Credit, collateral, eligibility, and program terms apply. Privacy · Unsubscribe",
  "builder_data": {
